### Create Course (Syncs with Moodle)
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Course Title",
  "description": "Course description here.",
  "status": "active",
  "price": 1000,
  "discount": 10,
  "creatorId": 1,
  "image": "https://example.com/image.png",
  "communityId": 1
}

### Update Course (Syncs with Moodle)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Course Title",
  "description": "Updated description.",
  "status": "active",
  "communityId": 1
}

# Both endpoints will create/update the course in Moodle and then in the local database.
